


<!-- =====================================================
         PHASE 3 BANNER
         ===================================================== -->
<div class="p3-banner">
    <div class="p3-phase-pill">Phase 3 · Rail-Linear Piston Engine</div>
    <h1>Steam-Rail <em>Linear Piston</em> Propulsion System</h1>
    <p>
        A clean-architecture retrofit replacing the dual-battery complexity with
        a single-battery electrical system. High-pressure steam drives pistons
        along parallel rails (locomotive-style) that directly rotate wheel
        assemblies, eliminating traditional oil/water contamination in enclosed
        piston chambers.
    </p>
</div>

<!-- =====================================================
         PHASE 3 METRICS
         ===================================================== -->
<div class="p3-section">

    <div class="p3-section-label">Phase 3 Architecture</div>
    <h2 class="p3-section-title">Simplified rail-linear drive · Single battery</h2>
    <p class="p3-section-lead">
        Phase 3 eliminates dual-battery bus complexity by adopting a single unified
        electrical bus. Steam pressure from the high-pressure reservoir drives linear
        pistons along dual parallel rails (similar to locomotive slide rails). Each
        piston connects to a wheel-drive linkage, rotating wheels directly without
        intermediate gearing. The rail design keeps pistons open to atmosphere,
        preventing oil/water accumulation and seal degradation.
    </p>

    <div class="p3-metrics">
        <div class="p3-metric">
            <div class="val">1</div>
            <div class="lbl">Unified battery</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p3-metric">
            <div class="val">2</div>
            <div class="lbl">Parallel rails</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p3-metric">
            <div class="val">H₂O</div>
            <div class="lbl">Steam propellant</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p3-metric">
            <div class="val">0</div>
            <div class="lbl">Sealed chambers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p3-metric">
            <div class="val">Direct</div>
            <div class="lbl">Wheel drive</div>
        </div>
    </div>

