    <h2 class="p3-section-title">Phase 3 — Rail-linear propulsion layout</h2>
    <p class="p3-section-lead">
        The steam pressure reservoir mounts centrally. Dual parallel rails run
        front-to-rear along the vehicle chassis. Linear pistons reciprocate along
        these rails, with connecting rods driving wheel hubs. Single battery
        provides heating and system control.
    </p>

